<title>TUNISIA: Tunis bourse index closes up in higher trade.</title>
<headline>Tunis bourse index closes up in higher trade.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tunis Stock Exchange index on Wednesday closed up by 0.24 percent in higher trade, bourse sources said.</p>
<p>The market's 30-share index closed at 604.56 from 603.09 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Trade volume was 3.59 million dinars against 2.34 million dinars.</p>
<p>UBCI bank gained 1.07 dinar to 51.5 dinars. Amen bank was up 0.7 dinar to 60.3 dinars.</p>
<p>($=0.98 dinar)</p>
</text>
